  "number": 1111,
  "title": "Wifi hotspots with 5g?",
  "body": "I know there aren't any rayhunter supported hospots currently listed that support 5g (unless I missed something?) but does anyone know if there are any 5g devices being worked on / actively ported presently? If not I would like to find a device for porting rayhunter. I was thinking about the Orbic Speed X 5G, although it only suppots wifi6 which is a bit of a shame. I'd prefer one with at least wifi 6e. If anyone has any suggestions on what device to use please let me know. Thank you.\r\n\r\nAlso wondering if I have a 5g sim card in the device can rayhunter work at the same time as the devices is working as a 5g hotspot, or can you only use the devices either for running rayhunter or as a hotspot but not concurrently? Thanks.",
