      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4BE3F8",
      "body": "For the US: https://github.com/EFForg/rayhunter/discussions/615 -- @wgreenberg has started an effort at https://github.com/EFForg/rayhunter/tree/inseego but it's not seen activity in a while\r\n\r\nFor the EU: I'm looking at TP-Link M8550 in the next 1-2 months\r\n\r\nWe're not in a rush since those devices are still too expensive anyway\r\n\r\n> Also wondering if I have a 5g sim card in the device can rayhunter work at the same time as the devices is working as a 5g hotspot, or can you only use the devices either for running rayhunter or as a hotspot but not concurrently? Thanks.\r\n\r\nI'm pretty sure that you're going to be able to use both at the same time.",
